+# Performance history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures are available for ingesting this project's own real Claude
+Code transcript.
+
+A smoke test exists (`crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs`,
+`parses_real_transcripts_when_present`) that parses a real transcript from
+`~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn/*.jsonl` when present and
+prints turn count, episode count, and tool-call count via `eprintln!`. But:
+
+- Its output is not captured anywhere: CI runs `cargo test --workspace`
+  without `--nocapture`, and no CI logs are committed to the repo.
+- `crates/muninn-bench/experiment/tasks.json` references a specific real
+  transcript file (`14a6ab47-9d1b-46ce-80c2-1b24c44ff8b8.jsonl`) as a seed for
+  the Gate 2 experiment, but only by path — no size, turn count, episode
+  count, or duration accompanies it.
+- Experiment run output directories (`out/`, `out-*/`, `run-gate2.log`) are
+  git-ignored, so no past real run's results are in the working tree or git
+  history (`git log --all` has a single commit, which does not contain any
+  such numbers either).
+
+The only committed performance numbers in this repo (`research/00-evidence-log.md`,
+`research/CONCLUSION.md`, `design/ENGINE.md`) come from a **synthetic** corpus
+generated by `research/bench/build_corpus.py`, not from ingesting a real
+Claude Code transcript. They are not a substitute for this figure and are not
+reproduced here.
+
+To fill in this section with real numbers, run the smoke test with
+`--nocapture` against an actual `~/.claude/projects/.../*.jsonl` file, note
+the file's size on disk, and time the run, then record the actual output
+here.
